= Major party ban

After the <span style="color: [+ nsdap_colour +];">**NSDAP**</span>-lead coup attempt in <span style="color: #00CCFF;">Bavaria</span>, the party and their ally <span style="color: #3D3D3D;">**DVFP**</span> are banned. Both as a reaction to the uprising in Hamburg and in an effort to appease conservatives the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> will be banned as well.

The <span style="color: [+ dnvp_colour +];">**DNVP**</span> profits a lot of being the strongest anti-establishement party now.



























